stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    [*] --> idle

    idle --> recording : record\n(hotkey / button)
    recording --> processing : stop\n(hotkey / button)
    processing --> done : 200 OK
    processing --> error : error

    done --> idle : record
    error --> idle : record

    idle --> settings : open settings\n(gear / hotkey)
    done --> settings : open settings
    error --> settings : open settings
    settings --> idle : close settings

    note right of settings
        Settings is an overlay panel,
        not a pipeline state.
        Recording controls are
        inaccessible while open.
        settingsOpen: boolean
        (orthogonal to RecordingState)
    end note

    note right of recording
        Settings not accessible
        during recording or processing
    end note
